caramos-ota (1.0.2-0caramos1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial CaramOS OTA updater package.
  * CLI: check, upgrade, status, repair, rollback, dry-run.
  * Daily update check via systemd timer.
  * Desktop notifier with GTK3 Vietnamese dialog.
  * Privilege escalation through pkexec/polkit.
  * Transaction state tracking and best-effort rollback.
  * Logging with logrotate support.

